[manpage_begin tuzipfs n 0.1]
[moddesc {Tcl utility modules}]
[titledesc {Tcl 9 ZipFS convenience wrapper}]
[require Tcl 8.6]
[require tclutils::tuzipfs 0.1]
[description]
[para]
The [package tclutils::tuzipfs] package provides a small wrapper around the
Tcl 9 [cmd zipfs] ensemble. The package loads under Tcl 8.6, but commands that
require ZipFS throw [const {TCLUTILS TUZIPFS UNAVAILABLE}].
[section COMMANDS]
[list_begin definitions]
[call [cmd ::tclutils::tuzipfs::available]]
Return a boolean indicating whether [cmd zipfs] is available.
[call [cmd ::tclutils::tuzipfs::mount] [arg archive] [opt [arg mountName]]]
Mount a ZIP archive and return the mount point.
[call [cmd ::tclutils::tuzipfs::unmount] [arg mountpoint]]
Unmount a mounted ZipFS tree.
[call [cmd ::tclutils::tuzipfs::listFiles] [arg mountpoint] [opt {-glob pattern}] [opt {-recursive boolean}]]
List paths below a mount point.
[list_end]
[manpage_end]
